    # note:  the run test is also the existence test (Apple added strchrnul in macOS 15.4; the x86_64 lane has none), so a literal answer is wrong on one macOS or the other; a link probe under the same name answers per platform and lib/sh/strchrnul.c follows it
    "probe:bash_cv_func_strchrnul_works": checks.AC_TRY_LINK(
